# Temporary test files

When a test file is created only to check a change, delete it after the test has passed.

- Do not leave `*.test.ts`, `*.spec.ts`, or one-off test scripts in the repo once testing is finished.
- Do not commit those files.
- Existing project tests that were already part of the codebase stay unless the user asks to remove them.
